  "reference_answer_text": "④",
  "reference_solution": "[정답] ④\n\n[해설]\n$\\cos \\left( \\frac{\\pi}{2} - \\theta \\right) = \\sin \\theta$이므로\n$2 \\cos \\theta + \\sin \\theta = 0$\n$2 \\cos \\theta = - \\sin \\theta$\t\t\t\t$\\cdots$$\\cdots$ ㉠\n$4 \\cos^{2} \\theta = \\sin^{2} \\theta$\n$\\sin^{2} \\theta + \\cos^{2} \\theta = 1$이므로\n$4 \\cos^{2} \\theta = 1 - \\cos^{2} \\theta$\n$\\cos^{2} \\theta = \\frac{1}{5}$\n$\\sin \\theta < 0$이므로\n㉠에 의하여 $\\cos \\theta > 0$\n따라서 $\\cos \\theta = \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}$\n",
  "problem_text": "$2 \\cos \\theta + \\cos \\left( \\frac{\\pi}{2} - \\theta \\right) = 0$이고 $\\sin \\theta < 0$일 때, $\\cos \\theta$의 값은?\n① $- \\frac{2 \\sqrt{5}}{5}$\t② $- \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}$\t③ $0$\n④ $\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{5}$\t⑤ $\\frac{2 \\sqrt{5}}{5}$\n",
